Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.930
Tanjiro as the embodiment of kindness even
in battle, is a very unique and refreshing

00:00:05.930 --> 00:00:09.510
take on the shounen hero trope, that is worth
looking at in detail.

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:10.519
By the way, this video has no spoilers for
season 2.

00:00:10.519 --> 00:00:15.000
I've really been looking forward to talking
about Tanjiro for a while now.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Even though I criticised the character writing
overall in my video on why you should watch

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.490
demon slayer, Tanjiro is not only an exception
to this but also easily one of the most interesting

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:38.309
ones in the show. In a weird way he is your
very stereotypical shounen hero on the one

00:00:38.309 --> 00:00:45.090
side and yet something entirely new and different
on the other. And I find his personality and

00:00:45.090 --> 00:00:48.300
philosophy extremely fascinating.

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:53.510
Hi my name is Manu, the only demons I've ever
