where was I? Oh yeah, I've been absolutely

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:11.090
obsessed with the beauty of the Kimetsu no
Yaiba Anime. And so I just had no other choice

00:01:11.090 --> 00:01:17.490
but analyse its main character and found some
surprisingly deep writing behind it. What

00:01:17.490 --> 00:01:18.490
do I mean by that?

00:01:18.490 --> 00:01:24.119
Well, on the surface, Tanjiro Kamado fits
the typical Shounen hero mold pretty nicely.

00:01:24.119 --> 00:01:30.720
He's a young boy, check, who goes on an adventure
fighting bad guys, check, trying to get stronger

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:35.890
to reach his goal, check and has a hidden
